<%# What the page is for, under its heading. A host whose proposals reach
    further than an agent's instructions replaces this partial with its own
    wording. %>
Suggested fixes for mistakes an agent keeps making. When a scorer has failed the same agent often
enough, a follow-up run reads those failed runs and drafts a change to the agent's instructions.
Each one lists the runs behind it, and nothing changes until you apply it.
